  "headline": "FDA lists liraglutide as a current shortage first posted 2023-07-18; no public FDA signal at our plants",
  "headline_cites": ["E9", "D3"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's shortage list shows liraglutide injection as a current shortage first posted 2023-07-18 and updated 2026-10-14.",
      "cites": ["E9"]
    },
    {
      "text": "As of 2026-10-21 the shortage has been on FDA's list for 39 months.",
      "cites": ["D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Four manufacturers are on the list: Hikma Pharmaceuticals USA, Inc. (Current), Meitheal Pharmaceuticals, Inc. (Current), Novo Nordisk, Inc. (Current, product will be available until discontinuation in January 2027), and Teva Pharmaceuticals USA, Inc. (To Be Discontinued, discontinuation of manufacture).",
      "cites": ["E5", "E6", "E7", "E8"]
    },
    {
      "text": "There is no public FDA signal at our plants.",
      "cites": []
    },
    {
      "text": "The rule-selected option is to buy from Biocon Pharma Inc., which is not on FDA's shortage list today and its label names no plant we could place.",
      "cites": ["D4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East has 8.6 days on hand and Corvale General has 14 days on hand for the 6 mg/mL, 3 mL presentation.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2"]
    }
  ]
